Music video by Wings performing Silly Love Songs, remastered in HD.

Directed by Gordon Bennet

Silly Love Songs features in 'The 7” Singles Box', a collection of 80 career-spanning 7” singles personally curated by Paul McCartney. The box set includes 163 tracks totalling over 10 hours of music, a 148-page book with a foreword by Paul, and is also released digitally.

'The 7” Singles Box' out 2 December 2022: https://PMC.lnk.to/7inSinglesBox

